From 0982951c0ea78cd99269273c572a24f7f33976c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abyss <abyss@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:24:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] abyss: cb_moe_ids in llama_context_params (and common_params)
 hands each MoE layer's selected experts to a callback at the synchronize
 after the ubatch: build_moe_ffn keeps a copy of the selection as a graph
 output after the fused routing nodes, and decode copies the copies to a
 pinned buffer along with the logits. The expert stats use it instead of an
 eval callback, which cut the graph at every layer's top-k (no fused routing,
 a sync and a graph launch per layer) and also counted the reshaped and cont
 views of the selection that the MoE cache's plans make

---
